{"strongs": "H3043", "word": "יְדִיעֲאֵל", "translit": "ye.di.a.el", "root": "ידד", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "Jediael", "definition": "יְדִיעֲאֵל proper name, masculine (Palmyrene ידיבעל DHM in MV 10, 983 compare Sabean proper name with ידע DHM ZMG 1875, 612 ) — 1. a Benjamite 1Chr 7:6 ; 1Chr 7:10 ; 1Chr 7:11 , ᵐ5 Αδειηλ, Ιεδιηλ, etc. 2. one of David's heroes according to 1Chr 11:45 apparently = the Manassite captain of 1Chr 12:21 ( Baer ; van d. H v. 1Chr 12:20 ), ᵐ5 Ελθειηλ, Ιεδιηλ . 3. a Korahite porter 1Chr 26:2 ᵐ5 Ιδερηλ, Ιεδιηλ .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3461')\">BDB3461</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3043')\">H3043</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3460')\">BDB3460</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3462')\">BDB3462</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>יְדִיעֲאֵל</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (Palmyrene <bdbheb>ידיבעל</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('DHM')\">DHM</lookup> in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MV')\">MV<sup>10, 983</sup></lookup> compare Sabean proper name with <bdbheb>ידע</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('DHM')\">DHM<sup>ZMG 1875, 612</sup></lookup>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> a Benjamite <ref ref=\"1Chr 7:6\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(13,7,6)\">1Chr 7:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 7:10\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(13,7,10)\">1Chr 7:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 7:11\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(13,7,11)\">1Chr 7:11</ref>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Αδειηλ,</grk> <grk>Ιεδιηλ,</grk> etc. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> one of David's heroes according to <ref ref=\"1Chr 11:45\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"45\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"45\" onclick=\"bcv(13,11,45)\">1Chr 11:45</ref> apparently = the Manassite captain of <ref ref=\"1Chr 12:21\" b=